 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids. October to November is the driest pair and came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 it ran 44% of normal on the middle, and November to December ran 35%. So far in 2026, March to April is at 39% on the middle, and grid 19098 has August to September 2026 at a preliminary 89.2.</p>"}
